        "geometry": "Frozen Orb: projectile that travels in a straight line, continuously emitting radial ice bolt sprays in all directions perpendicular to travel. On expiry: final radial burst. Multi-point footprint — covers wide area across full travel path. Described as 'low-invest one-point wonder and the projectile-that-emits.'"
